    "body": "> @matsdahlin what do you think how the layout would look like? Where / how would you like the email to be displayed? Should there be an option to display username instead of mail if configured?\r\n\r\n@oyanoya personally I would put it to the far right of the prompt with just the email \"name@email.com\" of the current git config.\r\nI usually have the same name for all profiles, but the email is what differs, others usage may vary so maybe an option for name would be good!",
