    "body": "> It can be done with `custom` module. Docs: https://starship.rs/config/#custom-commands\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> # ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n> \r\n> [custom.git-email]\r\n> command = \"echo $(git config user.email)\"\r\n> when = \"exit 0\"\r\n> description = \"Display git user email\"\r\n> format = 'git: [$symbol$output]($style) '\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> ![obraz](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2981598/160624509-064166be-7acc-4677-b844-6867231baa3b.png)\r\n> \r\n> edit: few minutes ago Rabattkarte has shared his approach which might be better 🙂\r\n> \r\n> [#1252 (comment)](https://github.com/starship/starship/discussions/1252#discussioncomment-2461567)\r\n\r\nI like your way better! Thank you 🙏🏼 ",
